INSPECT of 'k', USAGE comp: the item is usage display, or a group (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 1)
INSPECT: 'k' is USAGE comp; an operand is usage display (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 2)
INSPECT: 'g' is a group; an operand is an elementary item (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 2)
INSPECT: an ALL figurative constant is not an INSPECT operand (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 3)
INSPECT: a numeric literal is not an INSPECT operand; write it as "..." (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 3)
INSPECT REPLACING CHARACTERS BY: one character (X3.23-1985 INSPECT rule 8)
